#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:9
msgid "Add a reviewed Board package"
msgstr "接入复核的 Board 包"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:11
msgid ""
"Use this guide when the exact SoC already has a maintained provider. A Board"
" adds PCB facts and reviewed bindings; it does not copy a vendor SDK or "
"authorize every silicon route. Actual unobserved PCB revision, bridges and "
"voltage stay unknown."
msgstr ""
"精确 SoC 已有维护提供者时使用本指南。Board 增加 PCB 事实与复核绑定，不复制厂商 SDK，也不授权每一条硅片路由。实际未观察的 PCB "
"版本、焊桥和电压保持未知。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:15
msgid ""
"Prepare the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-checkout.md) "
"before using the resolver or build commands below."
msgstr "使用下面的解析器或构建命令前，先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:18
msgid "Gather the minimum facts"
msgstr "收集最小事实"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:20
msgid ""
"Record the full part, package, source document revision and retained "
"provenance. Record oscillator values, supply conditions, SWD reservations, "
"pins, active levels, jumper conditions and safe initial outputs. Distinguish"
" document defaults from an observation of your particular board. Start with "
"one LED and one console route."
msgstr ""
"记录完整料号、封装、来源文档版本和保留来源依据。记录晶振值、供电条件、SWD "
"预留、引脚、有效电平、跳线条件和安全初始输出。区分文档默认与这块实际板卡的观察。先接入一个 LED 和一条控制台路由。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:25
msgid ""
"Choose a maintained fixed clock profile matching those oscillator facts. A "
"new Board oscillator value does not synthesize an arbitrary PLL, power, "
"Flash wait-state or peripheral kernel-clock plan. Add and verify an exact "
"SoC profile before authorizing a new combination; parsing success does not "
"measure clocks or establish electrical qualification."
msgstr ""
"选择与这些晶振事实匹配的已维护固定时钟 profile。新的 Board 晶振数值不会合成任意 PLL、电源、Flash wait-state 或外设 "
"kernel-clock 方案。授权新组合前须增加并验证精确 SoC profile；解析成功不代表实测时钟或电气资格。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:31
msgid ""
"The following is a complete maintained Board file, including `soc_family`:"
msgstr "下面是完整维护 Board 文件，包含 `soc_family`："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:33
msgid ""
"Source-reviewed Qiming V3.1 facts; physical PCB revision remains unknown."
msgstr "来源复核的启明 V3.1 事实；物理 PCB 版本仍未知。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:38
msgid ""
"The [integration contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) owns field "
"and resource requirements. Keep your Board package in its external product "
"repository when it describes private PCB data. Public reusable packages live"
" under `boards/`; ordinary packages require only `board.json` and a README. "
"Add bounded neutral Board hooks only for electrical actions not expressible "
"by maintained data."
msgstr ""
"[接入合同](../design/integration-contracts.md)拥有字段与资源要求。描述私有 PCB 数据的 Board "
"包保留在外部产品仓库。公开可复用包位于 `boards/`；普通包只需 `board.json` 与 "
"README。仅当维护数据不能表达电气动作时，才增加有界中性 Board 钩子。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:44
msgid "Validate through the actual resolver"
msgstr "通过实际解析器验证"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:46
msgid ""
"From the Nexus repository root, inspect a known-good reference before "
"authoring:"
msgstr "从 Nexus 仓库根目录执行，编写前先检查已知合法参考："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:54
msgid ""
"For your package, select `board_package` in an external complete assembly "
"and run those same commands with its absolute path. Relative package paths "
"resolve from the authored assembly. A JSON syntax check alone cannot prove "
"SoC identity, clock, route or resource compatibility. Unknown fields and "
"unreviewed routes must reject."
msgstr ""
"自己的包在外部完整 assembly 中选择 `board_package`，以绝对 assembly 路径运行同样命令。相对包路径从人工编写的 "
"assembly 定位。仅 JSON 语法检查不能证明 SoC 身份、时钟、路由或资源兼容。未知字段与未复核路由必须拒绝。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:59
msgid ""
"To create an assembly from a reviewed private package, explicitly select its"
" clock and binding. The following is a command template: replace package, "
"clock and binding with your package's reviewed facts before running it."
msgstr ""
"从已复核的私有包创建装配时，显式选择它的时钟和 binding。下面是命令模板：运行前用包中经过复核的事实替换包路径、时钟和 binding。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:72
msgid ""
"Exactly one of `--board` and `--board-package` is required. The CLI package "
"path resolves from the working directory; the generated TOML stores it "
"relative to its own directory. The resolver rejects symlinked package paths."
" It allows ordinary parent-directory references, so a private Board and "
"product configuration can move together without placing private facts in "
"Nexus."
msgstr ""
"`--board` 和 `--board-package` 必须且只能选择一个。CLI 包路径相对于工作目录解析；生成的 TOML "
"将其保存为相对于自身目录的路径。解析器拒绝含符号链接的包路径，允许普通父目录引用，因此私有 Board 和产品配置可一起移动，无需把私有事实放入 "
"Nexus。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:78
msgid ""
"`provider-check` resolves the same typed IR and emits the real static bundle"
" into a temporary directory. Its report records family, part, Board, "
"backend, selected controllers, configuration-module paths, fact-input "
"identities, and generated-file hashes. Optional `--expect-family` and "
"`--expect-part` reject an unexpected selection. `resolved_typed_ir` and "
"`static_bundle_emitted` are generation checks; they do not establish "
"compilation, instance behavior or physical qualification. Add same-family "
"instances through reviewed routes and the existing provider; maintain a new "
"family implementation only when the actual SoC requires it."
msgstr ""
"`provider-check` 解析同一 typed IR，并在临时目录中实际生成静态 bundle。报告记录 "
"family、完整料号、Board、后端、选定控制器、配置模块路径、事实输入身份和生成文件哈希。可选的 `--expect-family` 与 "
"`--expect-part` 拒绝意外选择。`resolved_typed_ir` 和 `static_bundle_emitted` "
"是生成检查，不建立编译、实例行为或物理资格。同 family 实例通过已复核路由和已有 provider 接入；只有实际 SoC 确实需要时才维护新 "
"family 实现。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:87
msgid "Build and record the selected scope"
msgstr "构建并记录选定范围"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:89
msgid ""
"Configure your external consumer using its assembly and the locked ARM "
"toolchain. Keep baremetal and FreeRTOS in separate output roots. Check "
"resolved claims, vector/startup, strong handlers, ELF/BIN/map and every "
"physical RAM/Flash budget. Factory lookup must be pure before start and "
"instance state must remain isolated. Use a software Board fixture for "
"model/link testing; label its wiring accordingly."
msgstr ""
"通过自己的 assembly 和锁定 ARM 工具链配置外部消费工程。裸机与 FreeRTOS 使用独立输出根。检查 resolved "
"claim、向量表/startup、强符号处理函数、ELF/BIN/map 及每个物理 RAM/Flash 预算。Factory "
"在启动前查找必须纯净，实例状态必须独立。模型/链接测试使用软件 Board 夹具，并准确标注其接线性质。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/board-porting.md:95
msgid ""
"Prepare [HIL plans](performance-hil.md) without equipment. Physical "
"qualification requires a separately reviewed station, observed "
"Board/part/UID/probe/wiring, exact image and real raw measurements. Source-"
"reviewed pads never establish connector continuity, immunity or safe "
"electrical behavior."
msgstr ""
"无设备时准备 [HIL 计划](performance-hil.md)。物理资格要求独立复核工位、实际 "
"Board/part/UID/探针/接线、精确镜像和真实原始测量。来源复核的焊盘不建立连接器连通、抗扰或安全电气行为。"
